[3b] Regression diagnostics (linearity, homoscedasticity, normality)...
  --- Regression diagnostics (autosomal training genes, Human fibroblast) ---
  Normality of TE (actual, log2 scale, n=15,266): skew = -0.576, excess kurtosis = 5.199, D'Agostino K^2 p = 0, Jarque-Bera p = 0
  Normality of residuals: skew = -0.821, excess kurtosis = 4.758, D'Agostino K^2 p = 0, Jarque-Bera p = 0
  Homoscedasticity (Breusch-Pagan): LM stat = 596.985, p = 5.48e-89
  Linearity (Ramsey RESET, power=3 on fitted values): F = 39.913, p = 5.15e-18
  (in each test, p < 0.05 => reject the null of normality / homoscedasticity / linearity)
